post_text_pi:
Enkigilata oo Nkitanapat 20
3 nejoki ninche, ‘Toning'o iyie Israel, tinyikai iyie ena olong ng'utaki olarrabal taarare ilmang'ati linono: mincho oltau lino elepori; miureishoyu niming'aeng'ae, aashu mputukuny te nkaraki ninche;

4 amu Olaitoriani Enkai ino ilo olo te dukuya iyie, pee kilo amitu too lmang'ati linono, nikincho iyie timirisho.’
